Article 40 Anyone who, in violation of the provisions of this Law, commits any of the following acts shall be ordered by the health and health commission department to make corrections, given a warning and have the illegal gains confiscated; if the illegal gains are 10,000 yuan or more, a fine of not less than two times but not more than six times the illegal gains shall be imposed; if there are no illegal gains or the illegal gains are less than 10,000 yuan, a fine of not less than 10,000 yuan but not more than 30,000 yuan shall be imposed; if the circumstances are serious, the practice certificate shall be revoked by the original issuing authority; if a crime is constituted, criminal liability shall be investigated according to law:
(1) illegally performing family planning operations for others;
(2) using ultrasound technology and other technical means to perform non-medical fetal sex identification or non-medical selective termination of pregnancy by gender for others.

Article 43 Where a functionary of a State organ, in the family planning work, commits any of the following acts, which constitutes a crime, criminal liability shall be investigated according to law; if it does not constitute a crime, disciplinary action shall be taken according to law; if there are illegal gains, the illegal gains shall be confiscated:
(1) infringing upon the personal rights, property rights and other lawful rights and interests of citizens;
(2) abusing powers, neglecting duties, or engaging in malpractices for personal gain;
(3) soliciting or accepting bribes;
(4) intercepting, deducting, misappropriating or embezzling family planning funds;
(5) making false reports, concealing, forging, altering or refusing to report population and family planning statistics.
